\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces SGTONetV6 dual-mode architecture. The shared patch temporal encoder feeds two parallel branches. The base classifier (left) handles common states conservatively via graph-aware transition refinement, destination experts, and prototype logits. The rare trigger (right) computes a patch-attentive rare score and overrides the base prediction to class\nobreakspace  {}9 only when the rare score exceeds the calibrated threshold and boundary/precursor constraints are satisfied.\relax }}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
