\newlabel{fig:arch}{{1}{2}{SGTONetV6 dual-mode architecture. The shared patch temporal encoder feeds two parallel branches. The base classifier (left) handles common states conservatively via graph-aware transition refinement, destination experts, and prototype logits. The rare trigger (right) computes a patch-attentive rare score and overrides the base prediction to class~9 only when the rare score exceeds the calibrated threshold and boundary/precursor constraints are satisfied.\relax }{figure.caption.1}{}}
\newlabel{fig:arch@cref}{{[figure][1][]1}{[1][1][]2}}
